{"slug":"My-Pooping-Pigeons!-Inf-Money-GUI-Open-Source-80606","_id":"695623e3e2b3f9aafd9fe866","title":"Inf Money GUI Open Source","game":{"_id":"6949b83131e76adf3162b9bd","gameId":140327715500229,"name":"[☯️] My Pooping Pigeons!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":140327715500229},"features":"Credits to (SouljaWitch) helped me with the script \nPigeon Collector PRO – Script Description\n\nPigeon Collector PRO is a sleek and professional GUI designed to automate pigeon collection in your game. With real-time feedback, adjustable speed, and an easy-to-use interface, this tool makes collecting pigeons faster, smoother, and more efficient than ever.\n\n✨ Features:\n\nStart/Stop Collecting: Toggle collecting at any time with a single click or hotkey (C).\n\nFast Collection: Adjustable requests-per-frame slider to maximize collection speed.\n\nRequest Safety Warnings: Prevents sending too many requests at once.\n\nStatus & Feedback: Real-time display of collecting status, requests/sec, and total pigeons collected.\n\nError Handling: Alerts if no plot or pigeons are found.\n\nDraggable & Clean GUI: Move the interface anywhere on your screen with a polished dark theme.\n\nKeyboard Shortcuts:\n\nC: Toggle collecting\n\nUp/Down arrows: Increase/decrease requests per frame\n\nRight Control: Close GUI\n\nAudio Feedback: Subtle sound when a pigeon is collected.\n\nCustomizable Slider: Drag to adjust requests-per-frame with a live tooltip display.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://rscripts.net/raw/inf-money-gui-open-source_1766452427232_FjIdHd88uI.txt\",true))()","owner":{"_id":"655921209fc070077975c38a","username":"Ciphen","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/9ed8f471713d6d16f3e15715cdf0a29708eec6174a0069feb45fd0827147c2bd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/655921209fc07007